{"id":"17222759f0140cdd","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-embedding.md","title":"Embedding","display":"df-embedding — Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-embedding","aliases":["58-df-embedding"],"display":"df-embedding — Embedding","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-embedding — Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,A,B,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,f\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,A,B,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B,f\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(A=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)\">\\(B=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\in V\\)</span> for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8317eefb4572709e\" href=\"?note=8317eefb4572709e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-injective.md\">../batch15/58-df-injective.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Embedding}_S(f,\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\land\nA=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\land B=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;f(c^{\\mathfrak A})=c^{\\mathfrak B}\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,n,A)\\to\nf(g^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a))=g^{\\mathfrak B}(\\{\\langle i,f(\\bar a(i))\\rangle:i\\in n\\})\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,n,A)\\to\n(\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\langle i,f(\\bar a(i))\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\in R^{\\mathfrak B})\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}embedding} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Embedding}_S(f,\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal L\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak B,\\mathcal L)\\land\nA=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\land B=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\n\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst}\\;f(c^{\\mathfrak A})=c^{\\mathfrak B}\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,n,A)\\to\nf(g^{\\mathfrak A}(\\bar a))=g^{\\mathfrak B}(\\{\\langle i,f(\\bar a(i))\\rangle:i\\in n\\})\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\;\\forall\\bar a\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\bar a,n,A)\\to\n(\\bar a\\in R^{\\mathfrak A}\\leftrightarrow\n\\{\\langle i,f(\\bar a(i))\\rangle:i\\in n\\}\\in R^{\\mathfrak B})\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An embedding preserves all atomic relations.</li>\n<li>Quantification over argument tuples now uses the set-coded function predicate, and the image tuple is written extensionally; no type-annotation binder or implicit composition is needed.</li>\n<li>An elementary embedding additionally preserves quantifiers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-injective.md","status":"resolved","id":"8317eefb4572709e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Cst},\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n,\\mathcal L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\\in V$ for $n\\in\\omega$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../ba